{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a75c2ddb05a7fe2e1e3","chatId":"1c496a4ae5c94eb8a499abc61d69bad7","sessionId":null,"userId":77247,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1400,"promptTokens":1570,"completionTokens":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692851221476154,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a75c2ddb05a7fe2e1e2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452085951,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a75c2ddb05a7fe2e1e2","chatId":"1c496a4ae5c94eb8a499abc61d69bad7","sessionId":null,"userId":77247,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n杨辉和小林是辅导员，他们正在共同策划一个志愿者活动。他们在教室里做准备工作，杨辉突然看了一眼正在教室后排自习的小王，并小声和小林说了什么。然后两人相顾笑了笑。当他们结束这次“耳语”时，杨辉为首朝小王走去，邀请小王担任这次志愿者活动的组织者。小王看到杨辉和小林的那次密谈，并记得他们的微笑和对视。\n\n[问题]\n小王接下来会做什么？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小王选择忽略这次邀请，专注于其他事情，如学习或其他兴趣。\nB. 小王决定避免与杨辉和小林互动，以此来减少不确定性和潜在的尴尬情况。\nC. 找一个信任的朋友或同学讨论这个情况，表达自己的不安和疑虑。\nD. 小王决定将杨辉和小林的行为解读为对他能力的认可，他认为这是一个展示自己能力和贡献的好机会。因此，他积极响应邀请，参与志愿者活动的策划。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692851221476154,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a75c2ddb05a7fe2e1e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452085949,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"93703c06943848a8a0d00f888aa75a4a"}